The '''Fashion Shop''' is an [[Location]] in the {{Zone|Village}} on the [[Hub Island]]. It is located in a basement under {{Zone|Taylor's Shop}} and home to {{NPCSprite|Seymour}}

{{ZoneText|Talk to Seymour to view his range of Tuxedos for sale.}}

== Purpose ==
The '''Fashion Shop''' allows players to speak to {{NPCSprite|Seymour}}, who sells three Tuxedo sets:
